    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Builds the Turán graph T(n, r), checks that it has no clique of size r + 1, and shows that adding any missing edge creates one. For r = 2 this is Mantel&#x27;s theorem: a triangle-free graph on n vertices has at most n^2/4 edges.">

